data: {"id": "0b85719af6c749be-thinking-parallel_evidence-624", "run_id": "0b85719af6c749be", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将执行补证计划，调查 TerminatingStuck 的关键歧义。\n\n### 补证计划\n1. **读取 Pod YAML 完整 finalizers**：确认 `aiops.lab/hold` 是否仍在。\n2. **Pod Logs**：查看容器退出前（exitCode 137）的应用日志，定位 OOM 原因。\n3. **PromQL 查询 OOM**：验证节点上是否有 OOM Kill 记录。\n4. **DeepFlow Tracing**：查找退出前的 HTTP 请求。\n5. **Runbook**：获取 `pod-terminating-stuck.md` 确认流程。\n\n开始执行：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789103357509, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

